  "bodyHash": "923755ef6d125749",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>Particle Rain</strong> 以更具美感的粒子效果取代預設天氣，並新增霧氣、風力及沙塵暴等額外天氣特效。你甚至可以在遊戲內設定選單中新增或自訂天氣效果。</p>\n<p>Fabric 版本需要&nbsp;<strong>Fabric API。</strong></p>\n<p>若要<strong>設定</strong>，請使用指令 <code>/particlerain</code>&nbsp; 或載入器的模組列表選單。</p>\n<p>關於常見的<strong>相容性</strong>問題，請見<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f%2523teleports\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0\" width=\"775\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>若嵌入影片無法播放，請直接前往：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%252fembed%252foan4xH5RvH0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0</a></span></p>\n<h3>雨滴粒子</h3>\n<p>會傾斜落下，猶如受風吹拂般。暴風天氣時風力會更強。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\"></p>\n<h3>雪花粒子</h3>\n<p>下落時會緩慢旋轉。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\"></p>\n<h3>沙塵暴</h3>\n<p>塵土與灌木會被風吹過沙漠及其他乾燥生態域。支援模組新增的生態域。顏色會與下方方塊匹配。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\"></p>\n<h3>生態域色調</h3>\n<p>雨水與水流粒子會匹配該生態域的色調。原版生態域的色調不會這麼強烈。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\"></p>\n<h3>水面漣漪</h3>\n<p>當雨滴落在水面時出現。解析度會與你的資源包匹配。（可設定）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\"></p>\n<h3>水流痕跡</h3>\n<p>當雨水擊中由硬質材質組成的牆壁時出現。（可設定為在任何方塊上顯示）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\"></p>\n<h3>薄霧</h3>\n<p>降雨過後，滲入地面的水分將蒸發回大氣中，於地表上方形成薄霧。這些薄霧也會自然出現在標記為 `#c:is_spooky` 和 `#c:is_wet/` 的生態域中（同樣可設定）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\"></p>\n<h3>設定與自訂特效</h3>\n<p>你可以利用內建的設定選單，為特定方塊與生態域建立各種氛圍粒子特效，或編輯現有特效。</p>\n<p>可透過指令 `/particlerain` 或模組選單存取此選單。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\"></p>\n<h3><del>積水</del></h3>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puddles-floods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">積水功能已重新開發，並作為獨立模組發布。</span></a></em></p>\n<h2>其他連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/issues?q=is:issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">問題追蹤器</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpigc.art%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Discord 社群</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日誌／更新說明</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">替代鏡像下載</span></a></li>\n</ul>",
